 "summary": "The new inclusion, the compositum surjectivity and the root-extraction unramifiedness results have no existing equivalent in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the proofs reuse `IntermediateField.inclusion`, `adjoin.powerBasis`, `Algebra.TensorProduct.lift`, `IsAlgClosed.exists_pow_nat_eq` and the merged Kummer DVR and `IsUnramifiedWRT.baseChange` theorems. Mathlib's `productMap_range` and `sup_toSubalgebra_of_isAlgebraic` only cover subalgebras of one common field, so they cannot replace the surjectivity argument without extra plumbing.",
